MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Your loop

 matrix<Type> cov(n,n);
     for (int i=0; i<n; i++) { for (int j=0; j<i; j++) {
          cov(i,j) = exp(-D(i,j)/exp(covlnphi));
          cov(j,i) = cov(i,j);
          } }

doesn't fill the diagonal of cov.
Try 'j<=i' instead.

